WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.853
In wide form January and February are separate
columns Now

00:00:05.879 --> 00:00:11.887
one row represents a product rather than a
product-month This can be convenient

00:00:11.914 --> 00:00:17.506
for scorecards matrices and fixed reports The same
business

00:00:17.532 --> 00:00:21.440
relationship is being displayed differently but the
row grain has changed
